# Manage Orgs, Teams, And API Keys

Use this guide for day-two administration of org-scoped access and tokens.

## Web UI surfaces

- `/settings/orgs`
- `/settings/orgs/new`
- `/settings/orgs/:orgId`
- `/settings/orgs/:orgId/teams/:teamId`

These pages are the canonical admin flow for membership and team boundaries.

## Core org and membership APIs

- `GET /api/orgs`
- `POST /api/orgs`
- `GET /api/orgs/{id}`
- `PATCH /api/orgs/{id}`
- `DELETE /api/orgs/{id}`
- `GET /api/orgs/{id}/members`
- `POST /api/orgs/{id}/members`
- `DELETE /api/orgs/{org_id}/members/{user_id}`

## Team APIs

- `GET /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams`
- `POST /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams`
- `GET /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams/{team_id}`
- `PATCH /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams/{team_id}`
- `DELETE /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams/{team_id}`
- `GET /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams/{team_id}/members`
- `POST /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams/{team_id}/members`
- `DELETE /api/orgs/{org_id}/teams/{team_id}/members/{user_id}`

## API key APIs

Organization API keys:

- `GET /api/orgs/{org_id}/api-keys`
- `POST /api/orgs/{org_id}/api-keys`
- `DELETE /api/orgs/{org_id}/api-keys/{id}`
- `GET /api/orgs/{org_id}/api-keys/{id}/usage`

Analytics API keys:

- `GET /api/orgs/{org_id}/analytics/api-keys`
- `POST /api/orgs/{org_id}/analytics/api-keys`
- `DELETE /api/orgs/{org_id}/analytics/api-keys/{key_id}`

<Callout variant="warning" title="Privilege boundary">
	Treat org/team/key operations as admin-only; these surfaces are not end-user defaults.
</Callout>
